                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c7022348-5446-3d52-8b9b-6a3576ae21be",
                        "entry_id": "8dff95e4-1e15-3deb-8259-a6e217bd32ad",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Chechen (person)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "56629e07-577c-4575-8652-4050163ea7d1",
                                "sense_id": "c7022348-5446-3d52-8b9b-6a3576ae21be",
                                "text": "Солдаты, радуясь развлечению, торопились заряжать и выпускали заряд за зарядом. Чеченцы, очевидно, почувствовали задор и, выскакивая вперёд, один за другим выпустили несколько выстрелов по солдатам.",
                                "translation": "The soldiers, pleased to have some distraction, hastened to load and fired shot after shot. The Chechens evidently caught the feeling of excitement, and leaping forward one after another fired a few shots at our men.",
                                "english": "The soldiers, pleased to have some distraction, hastened to load and fired shot after shot. The Chechens evidently caught the feeling of excitement, and leaping forward one after another fired a few shots at our men."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
